WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Jamie jumps toward the cornered Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.700
The normal heavy dive hits Ryu.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.350
Standing heavy punch catches the dive launch.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.050
Light Arrow continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.750
The later Arrow hit keeps Ryu airborne.

6
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.950
Ryu lies at the wall after the Arrow ender.
